{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21926","headline":"观刈麦 · 白居易","name":"观刈麦","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"田家少闲月，五月人倍忙。\n夜来南风起，小麦覆陇黄。\n妇姑荷箪食，童穉携壶浆。\n相随饷田去，丁壮在南冈。\n足蒸暑土气，背灼炎天光。\n力尽不知热，但惜夏日长。\n复有贫妇人，抱子在其傍。\n右手秉遗穗，左臂悬敝筐。\n听其相顾言，闻者爲悲伤。\n家田输税尽，拾此充饥肠。\n今我何功德，曾不事农桑。\n吏禄三百石，岁晏有余粮。\n念此私自媿尽日不能忘。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21926.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21926","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}